cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FiniteVolumeMethod.jl"
abstract: "Julia package for cell-centered finite volume methods on unstructured triangle meshes (parabolic/elliptic) and structured meshes (hyperbolic, collocated incompressible, MHD/GRMHD, AMR, multiphase VOF, Lagrangian DPM, FSI, dynamic mesh, radiation, combustion). Research-grade v3 development branch, forked from DanielVandH/FiniteVolumeMethod.jl."
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cx-xd/FiniteVolumeMethod.jl"
keywords:
  - finite volume method
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - unstructured mesh
  - SciML
  - Julia
authors:
  - family-names: VandenHeuvel
    given-names: Daniel John
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6462-0135"
